# Root-level docs only. Docker patterns do not cross "/", so this leaves
# src/prompts/*.md in the build context — verified by build on 2026-09-07, and
# load-bearing: the runtime stage COPYs src/prompts, and loadPrompt() throws at
# the first model call if they are missing. Do NOT "tidy" this to **/*.md.
*.md

